[0.500, "o", "FRONTIER (4 takeable now)\r\n  130  build     130 - An interactive run on `cursor-agent`, `agy` and `codex`, with the gate measured in each TUI\r\n  324  build     324 - A composed plan gets a row of its own, `plan_composed`, chosen and carrying the goal's outcome\r\n  328  build     328 - The ticket report counts build 312's pasted table as a ticket, and leaves 299 of 327 Outcomes `unsaid`\r\n  329  build     329 - The floor reads `then`, `do` and `else` as the binary, so `if true; then git push --force; fi` passes\r\n"]
